description	"Wookiee Chuundar Loyalist 

Tough 2-life wookies who borrow Czerka Weaponry from their Czerka Slavers.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 25% slower RoF
- Vibrosaber
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- No Blaster Defense/Deflect
-- Chain Limit: 1
- Kashyyyk Side-Arm Blaster Pistol (2)
-- Prim only
-- 20%- Damage/25%+ RoF
- Det Packs (3)

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- 25% slower Skill Cd
- Strength (1)"